## Objective
- Conduct passive reconnaissance and vulnerability assessment against Spare's in-scope API surface (`api.sparelabs.com`, `platform.sparelabs.com`, `forms.sparelabs.com`, `routing.sparelabs.com`, `spare.com`) for bug bounty reporting.
- Prepare and submit findings as separate reports with byte-exact evidence from canonical SHA256 hashes.

## Important Details
- **Scope (IN):** `spare.com`, `sparelabs.com`, `platform.sparelabs.com`, `api.sparelabs.com`, `routing.sparelabs.com`, `forms.sparelabs.com`
- **Exclusions:** ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com/spare.com; third-party services; OOS hosts include `api.uat.sparelabs.com`, `api.staging.sparelabs.com`, `metabase.sparelabs.com`, `admin-*.vercel.app`
- **Rules:** Passive-first (GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps), no account creation, no data modification, sha256 for secrets only
- **Multi-version envoy LB:** Production runs multiple backend replicas behind envoy; older/vulnerable code persists on fast replicas while newer code on slow replicas → deterministic routing split, NOT probabilistic flapping
- **Vendor patch/revert cycle:** ~2026-08-20 a patch was deployed then FULLY REVERTED fleet-wide; most bypass findings are restored
- **Canonical body hashes (verified 2026-08-21):**
  - org-key oracle: `3099f1baba93ebf19434837bdd0552a72f110a262bd01528eb48e8ba71e0e8cd`
  - regions bypass: `27d83f3c…` (sha256 of 751B region registry incl UAT)
  - workos SSO oracle: `5b170be7b7829635753da63537ecfe9068be5eea0b0a6218ffd72b8770ae4414`
- **Evidence rebuild:** Canonical hashes in KB enable byte-exact evidence regeneration from fresh captures (~7 requests, ≤1 rps)
- **UAT fleet parity LOST:** `api.uat.sparelabs.com` now returns 401 on all routes; dropped from fleet-parity matrix
- **CORS partial patch:** ACAO header no longer reflected on 401 responses on patched replicas; ACAO+ACAC still reflected on OPTIONS 204 preflight and 200/public paths
- **forms.sparelabs.com bundle regression:** Chronic across 4 rotations (now `main.7f821c2b.js`, sha256 `769f794a…`); staging-to-prod pipeline lacks secret-scan gate
- **`/v1/public/terms` unstable:** Flipped 200→401→revert→400; demoted from reports

